            <xs:annotation>
               <xs:documentation>The active power value for the demand adjustment type. This supports requests to be made to a resource for some amount of active power provided by a particular response method, as specified by the method attribute (e.g. lighting, HVAC, wall mounted air conditioners, etc.).</xs:documentation>
